{"html": "<!-- Minimalistische Header voor Review Pagina -->\n<section class=\"review-hero-section\">\n    <div class=\"review-hero-background\">\n        <img src=\"/images/KidsFysioCapelle-team-2.webp\" alt=\"Kids Fysio Capelle Team\" class=\"hero-background-image\">\n        <div class=\"hero-overlay\"></div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"review-hero-content\">\n        <h1 class=\"hero-title\">Jouw ervaring telt</h1>\n        \n        <p class=\"hero-subtitle\">\n            Help andere ouders bij hun keuze en deel hoe Kids Fysio Capelle \n            jouw kind heeft geholpen met bewegen, groeien en stralen\n        </p>\n    </div>\n</section>\n\n<style>\n/* Review Hero Section */\n.review-hero-section {\n    position: relative;\n    height: 60vh;\n    min-height: 400px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    margin-top: 0;\n}\n\n.review-hero-background {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 0;\n    left: 0;\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 100%;\n    z-index: 1;\n}\n\n.hero-background-image {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 100%;\n    object-fit: cover;\n    object-position: center;\n    filter: brightness(0.8);\n}\n\n.hero-overlay {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 0;\n    left: 0;\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 100%;\n    background: linear-gradient(\n        135deg,\n        rgba(26, 92, 71, 0.9) 0%,\n        rgba(26, 92, 71, 0.7) 50%,\n        rgba(26, 92, 71, 0.4) 100%\n    );\n    z-index: 2;\n}\n\n.review-hero-content {\n    position: relative;\n    z-index: 3;\n    text-align: center;\n    color: white;\n    max-width: 800px;\n    padding: 0 20px;\n}\n\n/* Hero Title */\n.hero-title {\n    font-size: 3.5rem;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    margin-bottom: 20px;\n    line-height: 1.1;\n    text-shadow: 2px 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);\n    color: white !important;\n}\n\n.hero-subtitle {\n    font-size: 1.3rem;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n    opacity: 0.95;\n    max-width: 600px;\n    margin-left: auto;\n    margin-right: auto;\n    color: white;\n}\n\n/* Responsive Design */\n@media (max-width: 768px) {\n    .review-hero-section {\n        height: 50vh;\n        min-height: 350px;\n    }\n    \n    .hero-title {\n        font-size: 2.5rem;\n        color: white !important;\n    }\n    \n    .hero-subtitle {\n        font-size: 1.1rem;\n        padding: 0 10px;\n        color: white;\n    }\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 480px) {\n    .hero-title {\n        font-size: 2rem;\n        color: white !important;\n    }\n    \n    .hero-subtitle {\n        font-size: 1rem;\n        color: white;\n    }\n}\n</style>\n<!-- Elfsight Google Reviews | Untitled Google Reviews -->\n\n<div class=\"elfsight-app-4390dd71-9bdd-4665-a83a-0eb6a2efb9e6\" data-elfsight-app-lazy></div>", "scripts": []}